    "Name": "Slow",
    "Description": "Slowed Enemies receive multiple penalties related to movement or weapon performance.\nFreeze occurs upon reaching x100 Slow.\n\nSlowed Combatants have 50% Decreased Movement Speed and are less accurate.\n\nSlowed Guardians have 50% Reduced Movement Speed, 50% Decreased Jump Height, are unable to use Movement Abilities, receive ?% increased Flinch, and have a penalty to their Weapon Stats.\n\nSlowed Weapon Stat Penalties:\nStability, Handling, Reload Speed and Recoil Direction are decreased by 75%.\nStat Reduction takes place after Weapon Perks. Weapon Stats are considered uncapped before slow's reduction is applied.\nEg: 160 Reload Speed will be reduced be 40 Reload Speed. 80 Handling would be reduced to 20 Handling.\n\nOverload Champions become Stunned upon receiving any amount of Slow Stacks.",
